# React Components

- Use functional components and TypeScript props
- Components are presentational: no data fetching or stores
- Components must be reusable and composable
- No static UI or hardcoded data
- Pass data via props only
- Prefer React Server Components; add `"use client"` only when needed
- Follow levels: `atoms` -> `molecules` -> `organisms` -> `templates`
- For AI-driven UIs, require user review before applying changes
- Use accessible live regions for streaming updates (e.g. `role="log"`, `aria-live`)
- Keep keyboard focus stable; move focus only for errors

## File Naming
- `.tsx` component files use `PascalCase`
- Hooks use `camelCase` starting with `use`
